      "description": "Kusasenri is a vast grassland inside the Aso caldera, with a small pond at its center and grazing horses dotting the landscape. The sweeping views of Mount Aso's smoking crater against the green expanse are iconic. Horse riding is available in the meadow, making it a highlight of any Aso visit.",
